  always recommend testing!), there are several fancy functionals with e.g.
  range-separation, like HSE03/HSE06/LC-PBEh, and also MGGA functionals
  that depend on the laplacian of the density, like BR89, that are not
  fully implemented due to the infrastructure for these functionals being
  incomplete or non-generic.
